class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2192\" style=\"width: 1.519em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>as shown below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-28deea6ce15f17f1ec8038f1adf12184\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/28deea6ce15f17f1ec8038f1adf12184\"></div>\n\n\n<p>Now, from the original diagram, we have that</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"133\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2192\" style=\"width: 1.578em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2192\" style=\"width: 1.509em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2192\" style=\"width: 1.519em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mstyle></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Let's add these to our diagram.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-bea8bf28881fc2ac098d579892d43186\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/bea8bf28881fc2ac098d579892d43186\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, we obtain</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"134\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 9.972em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-it