    "q-143003": {
      "dom_id": "step-q143003",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14212914/assets/3abecc8d3b60b6c9796fc9c9449888c700d205aad90786fa9e4fee854cdc07e1.png)\n\nIn figure $ABCD$ shown above, which of the following are equal to the vector $\\overset{\\to }{BO}?$\n\nI. $\\overset{\\to }{BA}+\\overset{\\to }{AD}-\\overset{\\to }{OD}$\n\nII. $\\overset{\\to }{OD}-\\overset{\\to }{OC}$\n\nIII. $\\overset{\\to }{OC}+\\overset{\\to }{CB}$",
      "worked_solution": "- For the $1$st expression, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{BA}+\\overset{\\to }{AD}-\\overset{\\to }{OD} & =(\\overset{\\to }{BA}+\\overset{\\to }{AD})+\\overset{\\to }{DO} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{BD}+\\overset{\\to }{DO} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{BO}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For the $2$nd expression, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OD}-\\overset{\\to }{OC} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{CO} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{CD} \\\\  & \\ne \\overset{\\to }{BO}\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For the $3$rd expression, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OC}+\\overset{\\to }{CB} & =\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & \\ne \\overset{\\to }{BO}\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\".",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
